// ============================================================================
// PART 5: HARDWARE TOKEN & DISPATCH CHECKER
// ============================================================================

process qpu_check_dispatch_token⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    // Honest hardware boundary: Default to offline validation mode (0)
    // Live dispatch is only armed when an authorized hardware token is provided
    yield 0 ·
⟧